<div class="px-4 py-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8">
  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="space-y-2 border-b border-base-300 pb-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-neutral tracking-tight">
      <%= t('privacy.title', default: 'Privacy Policy') %>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
      <%= t('privacy.last_updated', default: 'Last updated: August 2026') %>
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <div class="prose prose-sm sm:prose-base max-w-none text-base-content/85 space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
    <p>
      At <strong>And God Said</strong> (<a href="https://andgodsaid.org" class="text-primary underline">andgodsaid.org</a>), we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting the personal information you share with us. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it to provide our Bible reading challenge platform, and how we keep your information secure.
    </p>

    <!-- 1. Information We Collect -->
    <section class="space-y-3 bg-base-200/50 border border-base-300/80 rounded-2xl p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold font-serif text-neutral">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-base-content/80">
        <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> When you register, we collect your username, email address, and password (securely stored using salted one-way bcrypt hashing).</li>
        <li><strong>Challenge & Reading Progress:</strong> We record the challenges you join, group memberships, daily chapter completion logs, verse likes, verse notes/comments, and your preferred Bible translation version.</li>
        <li><strong>Email & Delivery Preferences:</strong> We store your email notification settings and preferred daily reading delivery time.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical Information:</strong> We use standard HTTP cookies solely to manage authenticated user sessions.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. How We Use Information -->
    <section class="space-y-3 bg-base-200/50 border border-base-300/80 rounded-2xl p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold font-serif text-neutral">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-base-content/80">
        <li>To operate and maintain the And God Said platform, challenge leaderboards, and reading progress trackers.</li>
        <li>To send you scheduled daily Scripture readings and challenge updates based on your preferred delivery time.</li>
        <li>To provide essential transactional messages (such as password reset requests and challenge invitations).</li>
        <li>To facilitate community interaction (such as group discussions and verse comments) within your reading groups.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. Email Communications & Anti-Spam Compliance -->
    <section class="space-y-3 bg-base-200/50 border border-base-300/80 rounded-2xl p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold font-serif text-neutral">3. Email Communications & Opt-Out (CAN-SPAM / GDPR)</h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-base-content/80">
        We maintain a strict anti-spam policy. Daily reading emails are sent only to registered users who have enrolled in a reading challenge and opted in to receive daily emails.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-base-content/80">
        <li><strong>No Marketing Spam:</strong> We never send unsolicited commercial advertising or promotional email blasts.</li>
        <li><strong>One-Click Unsubscribe:</strong> Every automated email includes an unsubscribe link and a direct link to manage your email preferences.</li>
        <li><strong>User Control:</strong> You can modify your preferred delivery time or disable daily emails at any time in your <a href="/profile/email_preferences" class="text-primary underline">Email Preferences</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. Data Sharing & Third Parties -->
    <section class="space-y-3 bg-base-200/50 border border-base-300/80 rounded-2xl p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold font-serif text-neutral">4. Data Sharing & Third Parties</h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-base-content/80">
        We <strong>never sell, rent, monetize, or trade</strong> your personal information or email address to third parties or advertisers.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-base-content/80">
        We only share data with trusted infrastructure providers necessary to operate the service (such as cloud server hosting and transactional email transmission providers like Amazon Web Services SES and Resend) under strict confidentiality and security standards over encrypted HTTPS/TLS connections.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- 5. Data Security & Retention -->
    <section class="space-y-3 bg-base-200/50 border border-base-300/80 rounded-2xl p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold font-serif text-neutral">5. Data Security & Your Rights</h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-base-content/80">
        We implement industry-standard technical measures (including SSL/TLS encryption in transit and secure database storage) to protect your data against unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-base-content/80">
        You may update your profile details or delete your account and associated data at any time. For complete account and data removal assistance, please email <a href="mailto:support@andgodsaid.org" class="text-primary underline">support@andgodsaid.org</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- 6. Contact Us -->
    <section class="space-y-3 bg-base-200/50 border border-base-300/80 rounded-2xl p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold font-serif text-neutral">6. Contact Us</h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-base-content/80">
        If you have any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or how your information is handled, please reach out to us at:
      </p>
      <div class="text-sm text-base-content/90 font-medium space-y-1">
        <p><strong>And God Said</strong></p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:support@andgodsaid.org" class="text-primary underline">support@andgodsaid.org</a></p>
        <p>Website: <a href="https://andgodsaid.org" class="text-primary underline">https://andgodsaid.org</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
